Package: indi-tyr
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, indi-bin (>= 2.2.5)
Description: INDI telescope driver for the Prometheus Astro Tyr mount
 Controls Tyr harmonic-drive telescope mounts through USB serial or TCP/IP.
 Supports GoTo, Sync, tracking, guiding, Home, Park, shared precise slew speed,
 mount configuration, Bluetooth controller management and Wi-Fi settings.
 TCP management requires Tyr firmware v1.2.10 or later.
